Using a structured set of tools helps distributed teams coordinate tasks and ship code efficiently.', '/assets/images/blogs/remote-team-management-tools-checklist.jpg', '9', '1', '18', '1', '2026-08-13 06:27:12', '2026-08-13 06:27:12', '2026-08-13 06:27:12', NULL);
